/-!
# Generated: the regions of the register runs, far from the machine

Generated by `scripts/life_cert/emit_dsep_regions.py` (untrusted; Lean checks every statement).
Research note `N-22`. For every component list of the regions of the register runs of a `decJz`
activation (`decRunRegNZ`, `decRunRegZ`, `decRestRegNZ`, `dz2mk0RestRegion`): the components lie
in the zone of the module (`dsepT_<L>_zone`), are far from every class of module piece other than
the groups of the circuit (and the INC gate for the rest of the zero test, which runs beside it
with its tight footprint), and so far from every piece of the machine outside the circuit
(`dsepT_<L>_far`); the unions: `dsepT_runNZ_far`, `dsepT_runZ_far`, `dsepT_restNZ_far`,
`dsepT_restZ_far`.
-/

